# Production Convex deployment. NOT a secret: this URL is inlined into the client
# bundle by design. Secrets (SERVER_BRIDGE_SECRET, JWT key) live in data/auth.json
# per the project rule — never in .env (dotenv-expand mangles $).
# Local dev is unaffected: .env.local takes precedence over .env.production.
